plan:
    Divide the article into sections based on its headings. Think about the main points to make in each section.
    Information forms a directed acyclic graph — ensure the order of sections and their contents respects these dependencies.
    ?Confirm the sections with the user before proceeding.

rewrite: plan
    For each section:
    Rewrite to improve clarity, coherence, and flow. Use maximum 240 characters per paragraph.
